<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.7500 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Jan 21		  Jan 20</p>
<p> High			     75.6900		 75.1500</p>
<p> Low				75.8000		 75.8500</p>
<p> Open			     75.8000		 75.1500</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.7500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     7.745		   9.725</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Jan 21		  Jan 20</p>
<p> Hign			     46.8000		 47.1000</p>
<p> Low				46.9000		 47.4500</p>
<p> Open			     46.9000		 47.4500</p>
